ONLINE GAMES

First type MOUNT GAMES at the CP/M prompt.
Then choose J0:ADVENT, J0:ANIMALS or J0:MCHASE.
ADVENT starts expanded Adventure; answer its instructions prompt.
ANIMALS starts the animal guessing game.
MCHASE starts Maze Chase and requires an ANSI-compatible terminal.

These launchers reside on GAMES, not A0:.
They prepare data in I0:WORK and run the approved game on J:.
WORK must be readable and writable for preparation.
Use the game's own quit command to return to the CP/M prompt.
WORK files, including any temporary game data, are cleared at logoff.

Other material on GAMES may need compilation or a different machine.
Games requiring writes to protected J: are for download and local play.
